Hi Qingsong,

try replacing
  re.eval(rexp);
with
  re.eval("{"+rexp+"}");

eval evaluates only the first expression which is "library(GDD)",  
that's why you have no output. You have to enclose all your  
expressions in { } in order to make it into one expression.

Cheers,
Simon


