I think I had quite the same error on Ubuntu Dapper. The problem seems
to be that the java libraries are not found. For me, exporting the
library paths before installing helped:

export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=.:/usr/lib/R/bin:/usr/lib/R/lib:/usr/lib/jvm/java-6-sun-1.6.0.00/jre/lib/i386:/usr/lib/jvm/java-6-sun-1.6.0.00/jre/lib/i386/client

Depending on your java version, you might have to change the paths.

Hope it helps.

Frederik



